      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "EAST scene-text detection (cv2.dnn.TextDetectionModel_EAST)\n\nWraps the EAST CNN for scene-text detection (mirrors the east_text_detection_demo reference). Unlike the generic DNN pipeline, EAST's high-level API handles preprocessing, forward, decode, and NMS internally.\n\nPipeline:\n  Load Image\n   -> EAST Text Detect  (detection: rotated rects + axis-aligned bboxes)\n   -> Draw Polygon      (rotated quads drawn on the image, thickness=2)\n   -> Preview Image     (visualization of detected text regions)\n\nThe detector outputs:\n  - bboxes: axis-aligned {x,y,w,h,score,label} for the core 'Draw BBoxes' node\n  - quads: (N,4,2) rotated corner points for 'CV Draw Polygon'\n  - scores: per-detection confidence\n\nThe quads are wired to BOTH:\n  1. Draw Polygon (thickness=2): outlines on the original image\n  2. Draw Polygon (thickness=0): filled quads on the original image (overlay)\n\nTo create a pure black/white mask, wire a blank IMAGE/MASK into Draw Polygon with thickness=0.\n\nModel: east_text_detection_2026jul.onnx\n  Source:  https://huggingface.co/opencv/opencv_contribution\n  License: Apache-2.0 (OpenCV)\n           https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
